QUESTION
Which papers satisfy these requirements: the abstract explicitly includes at least one of “we present an exact solution” or “in excellent agreement with experimental” (case-insensitive) and also explicitly includes “dna microarray”; and at least one author is affiliated with Shahjalal University of Science and Technology?

